{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41347","headline":"与诸门生春日会饮繁台赋 · 王仁裕","name":"与诸门生春日会饮繁台赋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳阴如雾絮成堆，又引门生饮古台。\n淑景即随风雨去，芳樽宜命管弦开。\n谩夸列鼎鸣钟贵，宁免朝乌夜兔催。\n烂醉也须诗一首，不能空放马头回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仁裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}